Login command
==============

curl.exe -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"username":"jhocelbduga","password":"mypassword123"}' "http://localhost:5000/customer/login"

Output
======

{
  "message": "Login successful.",
  "token": "<JWT_TOKEN>"
}

Note: The JWT token is generated dynamically and expires after one hour. Replace <JWT_TOKEN> with the token returned by the login request.
